{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj5A4iTJ4wKg6pMbeZk5","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The ancient wooden door stands before you, its grain weathered by centuries of wind and rain. Iron rivets dot its surface in patterns that might be constellations — or might be warnings. A heavy ring hangs from the mouth of a cast-iron lion.*\n\n*You insert the key.*\n\n*A deep resonance moves through the wood, through the stone frame, through the ground beneath your feet. The lion's iron jaw slowly closes around nothing. Tumblers older than memory shift and fall into place — each one a sound like a dropped coin in a cathedral.*\n\n**CLCK.**\n\n*The door exhales. A thin line of warm amber light splits the darkness vertically as it drifts open, just barely, just enough. The air that escapes smells of old paper, candle smoke, and something sweet you cannot name but have always known.*\n\n*Beyond: a spiral staircase descending into soft golden light. The stones are worn smooth in their centers by footsteps you will now add to.*\n\n*The door is open.*\n\n*Will you enter?*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":235,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}